Monthly Traffic Flow Analysis: Tai Lam Tunnel New Toll Implementation (Nov 2024 – May 2026).

This dashboard examines traffic trends before and after the new toll scheme introduced on 31st  May 2025.

 💡 Start point (Nov 2024): the last toll adjustment before the franchise ended and operations were handed over to the government.

 💡  End point (May 2026): the latest available dataset from data.gov.hk.

🔹 Disclaimer  
 
Data used in this analysis is sourced from data.gov.hk. All interpretations, calculations (including use of average monthly flows to represent toll plan periods), 
and visualizations presented here are my own to showcase my Power BI Portfolio and do not represent official government analysis.
